{
  "id": 8834720170183,
  "title": "Christmas Cardinals Near Snowy Birdhouse Patchwork Floral Quilt",
  "handle": "christmas-cardinals-near-snowy-birdhouse-patchwork-floral-quilt-b90d55a935-b90d55a935",
  "body_html": "<p>Embrace the cozy warmth of the holiday season with this beautiful quilt set by Jeminise. Featuring a charming winter design of vibrant red cardinals gathered near a snowy birdhouse, this quilt adds a peaceful touch of nature to your guest bedroom, vacation home, or master suite. Crafted for comfort, it provides the perfect blend of seasonal style and breathable warmth, making it a thoughtful gift for birthdays, holidays, or any red bird lover.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Personalized Design:</strong> Customize your quilt by adding your custom name or special text requests to create a truly unique bedding piece.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Cozy Comfort:</strong> Features a breathable soft polyester outer fabric layer filled with high-quality silk floss for continuous warmth and comfort across all seasons.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Beautiful Holiday Motif:</strong> Adorned with a realistic patchwork design featuring Christmas cardinals, a birdhouse, poinsettias, pinecones, and soft snow elements.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Complete Bedding Options:</strong> Available as a standalone quilt with the option to add matching pillowcases (2 or 4 pieces) to complete your bedroom set.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for indoor bed or sofa lounging, backyard relaxation, or outdoor use during camping trips and picnics.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water; quick-drying and designed to fluff up beautifully after washing.</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h3>Product Specifications</h3>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Quilt Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Floral-bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Animal</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Bird</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Patchwork</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>Winter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>Throw (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full (80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Quilt + Pillowcase (Optional)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>",
